---
import Icon from "../design-system/Icon.astro";
---

{/* What this device holds of a card's item, after its facts: a blue download arrow once it is saved
     offline, never in words. Played is not shown on a card (owner, 2026-11-03: a list of green and blue
     circles was loud); the podcast page says it (HeroMarks.astro). Rendered hidden and shown by the
     card's own data-downloaded (library.css; libraryMenu.ts sets it), so the mark takes room only
     while it is shown and the facts before it never change. */}
<span class="status-mark status-mark-downloaded"><Icon name="arrowLineDown" /><span class="sr-only">Downloaded</span></span>
